# Hierarchical Gate Report Substitute

REPORT_STATUS=UNSUPPORTED_NATIVE_COMMAND_SUBSTITUTED

The active Genus build does not provide the native command(s) this
report previously tried to call. This file is written deliberately
instead of emitting an invalid-command failure.

Unavailable commands:
  - report_gates -depth 20
  - report_gates -hier
  - report_gates -hierarchy

Substitute evidence to review:
  - report_gates.rpt
  - report_hierarchy.rpt
  - report_area_hier.rpt

Genus 22.13 on the lab server rejects the hierarchical report_gates options seen in the 124954 log. The plain gate, hierarchy, and hierarchical area reports are kept as the supported evidence set.
